COMPILATION OF: E46M7

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M7

   1 a 0000 E46M7:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] TWO CHARACTER VARYING scalars in one file PUT, and
   4 a 0006      the same list on the console. A varying item emits NO width byte
   5 a 0006      (the length lives in the cell [C293]), so this is the purest
   6 a 0006      concatenation test there is. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, w char(20) varying;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M7OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,w);
  10 c 0044   put list(v,w);
  11 c 0062   close file(outf);
  12 a 0068 end E46M7;

CODE SIZE = 006B
DATA AREA = 0033
FREE SYMS = 389D
END  COMPILATION
